  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "左有噬熊，右有囓虎。前觸銕矛，後躓強弩。無可抵者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e732f837a6b6fad7ac85709798582400ada31c6f6438dd0b9acb8d84786c4ead",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b87beb7812fc1efca540ad70f94163b27ceedc363addb42585c4de92e631ebc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "金齒鐵牙，壽考宜家。年歲有儲，貪利者得。有其咎憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:57e885dfa623790b6bc271df47dd1ff70297cf2ece4bc043fcf39f0c4068e219",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:beb01d23b5af150ff73bf86d122b4c8a0993a5e8f4c85ab669aa871fa320fbd6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "家給人足，頌聲並作。四夷賓服，干戈櫜閣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:388debca38f68a87f540b9bba93ca8cafed6089250b04accbf1d3571eee40d35",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b9635edabb65766fd971bd58d0b08e01e08e578ed3e67aee29d6794080ece822"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "獮猴冠帶，盜載非位。眾犬持吠，狂走蹶足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4332483b278c1efb230efc11398ed34882ec75c081ea3e26a3740276d0836eda",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4e19e0c73a3940374772fb1dd81dafa5b6e44cfa361f6f3068f284766dd1e9e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "心患其身，不念安存。忠臣孝子，為國除患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d6f0abe3162f7c22e847ce2307d6b03ce1bb6db67dd8c1e4b329ed1ebba36a92",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:690cf9368323f34d5df059d5b2c0e8d41f15c2c9c4f1debe03400cd1c1a44af4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "君不明德，臣亂為惑。丞相命駕，胡亥失所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eefcc15e38e47dd72e1b8ed65a75dfee1a7a001fe48aae03477da57abf40d2e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fb9b2085dab4cf1a946831f6fa23e736f121333b73a82adf9c6f7737d14126a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "東行西窮，南北無功。張伯買鹿，從者失羊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3813a0c4e6c4015b5b853945d31027e53e4d1fd405022070c16aae5bdcdce316",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:08e296a6aa7dacb817d1f4040336ba4ca27cac48b1c76a2e56773535194554e0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "鹿下西山，欲保其群。逢羿箭鋒，死於矢端。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5db028be03d9dcbea7901e944ba1d1663ba3b0d11e5bbe0c9a9b14b430869c85",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:621bdbc2444095b3ca405f46e0494c7b9500732f1b654315d341120bc600a260"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "夷明兆初，三旦為災。以讒復歸，名曰豎牛。剝亂叔孫，餒卒虛丘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e65a2296a13417cfbd618a1426d6227f0984ec1ef417d4b1b83e642d04ae3f83",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3176152758883ca1790a1e8d45ce38d66d058bfd18c8e7006f661c3f67516ffd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "秦失嘉居，河伯為怪。還其銜璧，神怒不祐。織組無文，燒香不芬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f86582ee3d212e89ec2464f0fb56f11901f336ba0bc75793573682064ace18bf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65e5f626cf9d39c027f9e5ab023a67bf38596da0d1838584d3478256f4caa0b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "至德之君，禍不過鄰。使我世存，身無患災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6ef933e5d908774339e27d322175e63aeb269b31779780e54d01f53c16d92ded",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22682a26f143a0d92ff6c1c4394fd485791b5066b4413d1b8d4b336ffda406bc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "眾惡之堂，相聚為殃。幽毒良人，使道不通。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e62f331e09ef6f772ce1fe768e3945e909bc6ddd3adefdf5dc1734e9de0e63dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1a970f0c93da169e1324f6f81b6eec62ff0c81f58edec5dd6e19e0981c7b0937"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "三痴六狂，欲之平鄉。迷惑失道，不知昏明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:066a34b6c065ed7c9eccc359484cc4e0a3180249231613a0f69dc5734ce2a932",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:359249d7f0f034ec6a7d831ebe4c6bd200140262b7322e47097c79de9a7693c6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "老弱無子，不能自理。郭氏雖憂，終不離咎。管子治國，侯伯來服。乘輿八百，尊祀祖德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4fb07b6f006cebc789b6c8761ff33f9a09de9c56676cf6808aeaf9d9045aa54e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c82e3ff15490c70c22036f0228de1ff88fe36b8b36dd2d7cab37d7ee22cfd454"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "褒后生蛇，經孝曰微。追跌老耄，復滅黃離。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c08a51474b4769bcf9b16cf979e8fc83b25dbc8408269f1d53bd1807b80e0dc2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f42c34d9b9a5a6dfb0ef27a3ecd3bc2adda41b0c8104baefecdca841d996bd59"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "聰鬣黑髯，東歸南鄉。白虎推輪，蒼龍把衡。遂至夷傷，不離咎殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e7ea8b50e39388347793beb8acaea56c395c4a074a29ac752e240a06fa194a12",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6fab4435a914ce7fa90d91bb4ee7b7c688c9fe6f4fec8f90ca53e266c88699e7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "信譎龍且，塞水上流。半渡決囊，楚師覆亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec4c9ee10eaa78d635488cab203c14c7edf53a6ffcbb7e2a3ab61fd211a221fe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:10bffb2ba717ccf63d0429af1089b20af464e043072ba82785b9f111813e91af"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "有莘季女，為王妃后。貴夫壽子，母尊四海。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9cc519ecdd37f7259be61df4001906d483fa2a869de47774d303ad4fd3cd44b4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:13dcb3341ea214cd93fa19d8716200dc40e79a5d3314fe591e5b7d11bfa29304"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "德被八表，蠻夷率服。蝥賊不作，道無苛慝。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be61abc9db7a193254b0096010b3ecc0a84ccde24fb55e05fb9c41ebd57d246b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:48f006d05acd83af3e682edb1fccf4d6d92d9dfc6b6f47acaaff82429e3061c2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "載日精光，驂駕六龍。祿命徹天，封為燕王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:91dd4b9f4478ad848707aea9d762bc10862448470f09d873f13a9398da636864",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0c5bd6fa9fee95a6254c577a4cebfbc2a5cec0a6a6b4e3e89f637a252f3972a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "纓急縮頸，行不得前。五石示象，襄伯不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94ce8bf1b90eb364aa0f03ab19fdea1b89bedfa6539c353d394c1a1e2dcb9d55",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7b7b1fd490b9df87d894596b25e6fd0b2ece32aec62bcc4ad9baa85dbae762be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "蛇鄉其穴，載麻當喪。哀悲哭泣，送死離鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6b31f3977af13462e1aca93c5c04fbf068f65f7735332cd61eb8355d2c04b544",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:04440810182f47d68b0866bffd3a5b5e116f97ae5a13c57b21961d2d90c58b4b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "四隤不安，兵革為患。掠我妻子，客屢饑飢寒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06929f30bb0be719a18a6eeefebd7a3f40a224c40d872a7f665e54bca623c1bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ffcede50e6e4ab68e10d38b9c56502f146ac032c46c502cee99249b61d4aa426"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "乘風禹橋，與飛鳥俱。一舉千里，見吾愛母。一作雨）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2ab34d3f236b5f9b05c522af1c6b7b9c4e33677090553f2fe57242ba2410e037",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5134e8045a646299eb0974f72075b9562b5c480246254a69339892c97654fe62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "雷霆所擊，誅者五逆。劘滅無迹，有懼方息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8cace7f56407fc736d1ea984c1493e14631f0305b0d05d26a7c978abbc2b617d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:03563a1ff1cedbd2a62ba005a48f23f455f4cb276e00375fc4ee4eac83365fd5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "張氏揖酒，請謁左右。王時枯槁，獨不蒙所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a1e0b86d03fe57f2f39d0a874c7da42a0a3d8cc2c3f2476e3d8459e20d455263",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:51a59e7b76b55db26aca1947d91fb2b56f6fd78c822e8ef86dee7810c4ebcbe7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "坐爭立訟，紛紛匈匈。卒成禍亂，災及家公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d3691b79e47cb1e2c34c9646c4db925886afa37101627e3cb09c5ffc1ab8c828",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d54f5a2351e4d3c33bc26964ce4fa2cd49e9a50b1496bfdac8fd2060ec2051b1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "霜降門戶，蟄蟲隱處。不見日月，與死為伍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:13fb1ce641f53b878cafae0dd9d2e6596d46a3cce288d71a68b2f35d88ff920c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f892f55fe2b21d483b3a08ccaf94bcc7fe4df2c6fad8544913d8a9b37c64796e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "鼠聚生怪，為我患悔。道絕不通，商旅失意。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:effd79683667523fa29da85a0d6bc2971fbf4ede8f7d066b1bc6008a5f5feca5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8ff5987a63a3c8c2a73e0d60858227c4245f35bec160d3e1238cf647444169f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "寒暑不當，軌度失常。一前一後，年歲鮮有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9ea4bd8ebd37475c440240de43aefe391c44259e3847934bf35b0e04b680dc90",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:77d727e81f81477c556da638a9c05df1f0308553f9dd4f950a4c25bc7ff3ff22"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "築室水上，危於一齒。丑寅不徙，辰卯有咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b8f09fb24b1f374ebc4277d04afb2b78cd1d6ceea47216ddbf376f7d7ceb4f1a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd9b83fbad52c0065213f545e98feea0e50c6edc31eeac58363869ce95b34cae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "畜雞養狗，長息有儲。耕田得黍，主母喜舞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dbd1dfba71d41ee7a06dcb56eb7abde01feb30c0aa56e4ade0b8daa9fbaacfad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad80ccbaffeb7ba3f07a9e034f5b89ec3af2f23013c9f467a92ecd87f79008a1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "東壁餘光，數暗不明。主母嫉妒，亂我事業。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:28165d0407ed9ecf127534940067aeef6dc58fe187758a854de5bfb8f70e4397",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d5c879c121134cad8dc515ed001bbae86235ce5cca5d9807e80f6e77eeda3c0e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "剛柔相傷，火爛銷金。鵰鷹制兔，伐楚有功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:950bf5c2bffeb2fc3a1a6399e3b58c7b36bf7f7ced45de24ae11350babdc8bf9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4771b7b8bb292e8b9c2c846f17e5dfa78465b1676d4d11360e4285faaed3af68"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "鄭國讒多，數被楚憂。征夫愁苦，民困無聊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4811f699d694d8074d8c392654178c665f8fe7aa7ce5cd50f19b2e5e1ab198ff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91a7f26b892176d764fa05077233f18a1931d92ba72e4ca3280170d46639392b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "弓矢斯張，把彈弦折。丸發不至，道遇害患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a902a0d53f80e5c1fc55f8da54fc56ac7f72e250d4a60fb47cea83e829824347",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dd230fba9c415642ba720fd32f3c8e4dcb8a64639a29e1beae99f2ec60fb4b71"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "舉觴飲酒，未得至口。側棄醉酗，拔劍斫怒。武侯作悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ab5b50f5a58a14d4ff89a4564370f1945139830eb58631f59408f494beaf7766",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:45d8067b990faafcdc359676c7eefa33e26d057bee5afa51df1776883fcf65ed"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "蒼鷹群行，相得旅前。王孫申公，驚奪我雄。北天門開，神火飛災。如不敬信，事入塵埃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ef806a86008c27001c075d344b1c9a118000f3fbb2b5428287637c2800d5425",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7ce29720f3f365225029c5344d53691b250e68684f7282a0a829a2d1d3ebfa5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "穿屋相宜，利倍我北。循邪詭道，迎不可得。南北望邑，遂歸入室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:57861cf661b391bc879a438d33da1eda37e0ab7ddcffb6716669532168beb682",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad37050d1a8dafa7390fd6db892d0ba091c5cb73378372a80dbf68cd387f1ce9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "壽如松喬，與日月俱。常安康樂，不離禍憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:68a55ff498894e94eb1e8fc9232fde1d1167a5e3bd155fcbb175d3df73a55e98",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8095c61c6cd5da10cea511e808a18cab4336126d2b858e07eaaaba4ee9bc0d4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "出門望東，伯仲不來。疾病為患，使母憂歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f9e14c7b1e51ad4cce1dafdb16f723d7e4e8f14e19c50511559028c8b598655",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c0a5797d49a2147a8fcd451f9fd06beffbbfc253bac7982ef0f99bb222fb9d4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "太姬之孫，周文九子。咸遂受成，寵貴富有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a2b912081040ae678380b60ef65d7db698c42f9ec761085aef349b34bf5f1d8e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f8926f1a8740697437407c26ae6c9796146025887d4cd7c1ed60734bfd534669"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "桃李花實，纍纍日息。長大成熟，甘美可食。為我利福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4af21da7581d15df65064baa14dd3858e49390c02b202c5a6081b2cf7f98291e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f31cd703e969abb43197900d0206e8042c0ab801f63577a6103690730c296cb4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "婚禮不明，男女失常。行路有言，出爭我訟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d0d64d6bb3b5887c1ed4028c1f8d76e7a2119099ddbdf2693394c56d209080ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a46eec761b00253f8964a9d1f9b3b16803c3838a2f6c33a486f9d0504136d37"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "空穿漏敝，破桴殘缺。陰弗能完，瓦碎不全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:489f6089d6726dbe1f13cf43436eef0b3730e6fd79e8fe3e9e51a1d9f19850dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:da98d5ebf8261c48eb68bf1922746c3f1b17e8e5b079e3e7d3f3917a7848d62b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "數窮廓落，困於歷室。往登玉堂，與老侑食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e394fe0a5874e4024409dfd0e9d744347c802432fe2cdbbece34c57682021531",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c690501609192083da617c169eed8489380f2fea724834429997a8f17e6430d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "道溼為坑，輪陷躓彊。南國作諱，使我多畏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:55adb9819a1ebed24592ea36a8290feea7be42242c25c9f10aed0200da3d422f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32479fe55dc12c9bb4d20f8fa47eba5f5a0064afddacf8663c926eec94881de4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "鰥寡孤獨，福祿苦薄。入室無妻，我子哀悲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:78e9f54b4cf74911746e8272249b386eb4487343b3f8b9451769b2ab40e0997b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2edb7a0e352b9eeb5e20641e2ab8134080f95917db4983180dc220d8a6572dbc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "舉袂覆目，不見日月。衣衾杖几，就其夜室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:515db5f4b9e3bb5148b8565a38af2e253d8f9743007d3dfa27121ac1f62d8d4f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ffe9e1d9c3d590ceb21c122d0a119108ccc850dd462dade8b29b69b8573d8287"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "長尾踒跎，畫地為河。深不可涉，絕世之比。憫然憤息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd3a3cfb1ed81cc248e59383d5431153b92b453773b304e9b9a1ab6c7ba0d1cb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3475981e32e30a89ca48d23d77cc4324246f83591da7a6bffb0551f5217b2b51"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "晨風文翰，火舉就溫。昧過我邑，羿無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9cf0d13756823ce372ed75e81b38b2c99daccac2cbecb1aa9c6dc0aa6da26bba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9e5aa2cf884a508a8ebed3d907d30afa23cbcbef2f5ab6025b4bdcd3b724cf2c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "出入節時，南北無憂。亟行所逐，在外來歸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8be0ca3dabc4bf227e3eeb421b72b4255aeb200ec9bf2308812a7f95e2198ab3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e10dc61dedd845504138f3b31a51f56e94249813017b46f1961cee899364c878"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "陽氏狂惑，季孫亂潰。陪臣執政，平子俱折。季心不快。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1c9d89cb7b2ebb0c066081c82bbb32e904818651ce9efcd2e5fdd0400a35a3b4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:74b6e2ef3a3d5ece582e7bc7125d0c069ee66295ee816677bb7b14f28c3a4c28"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "五鳥六鴟，相對蹲跂。禮讓不興，虞芮爭訟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4fb4e7c56b6bfcc5035dbbb46f1a6d0fdd9cb7a48cd142d73b0b1928ff9775da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f3219dcbafbf944dd38a50d8f9369d7227a34181e4ab1d06f8176a0725aaf3ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "願念所生，隔在東平。遭離滿沸，河川決潰。幸得無恙，復生歸室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bfc0149d1228ccb7b98084ac205972263c717a41b8648b15c22e73aa14899054",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4f3ac37b402c58e34d6a3affa0805283feb9676f0b680c382eb5f364face817"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "追獵東走，兔迯我後。吾銳不利，獨空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:992c211c1cec258d23940b9cb3f157821c08d375d536e0fb24a9614e39c5791f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8ac63594b440d8537b1e9212a6def3ec46981725fcb38ad76f5adb32c207962"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "犬吠非主，上下渾擾。敵人襲戰，閔王逃走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:25cfa28c865b3ed59244340769312d8c0d4049d0cb6535b2655c8e70e3c7aa5c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b3a8699a51de5f0979f0b1afb74406cf3b179f6d6f833559ad59053cecab2dc5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "嵩高岱宗，峻直且神。觸石膚寸，千里蒙恩。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:48a5ca03314f1db2d5d1a0c9e1387bd32bed0b4dbf739ca282e5426633b38e17",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e753a61325089c552ad2f4b26287cc07c30dd3ea058162f17476f111007e6825"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "陳魚觀社，狼虎踰距。為民開緒，亡其祖考。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4445847ff52ddcbf481b3d3e53415fa5115c572b79d1138039fb30d4046fbfe2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd0a09bcb1c16b07f6773e0287db59f6fdb50f0a0dfc3ca6f2ec86547422ae27"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "四壁無戶，三步一止。東西南北，利不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b030fa64bd02d7dec7d60f5079478a28a9e9534fce8783a36585ae1965ae846f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d54ffd5cb78c5bf7c39e32e6de4bd9c71254e882403e8dbac88df42bf25090af"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "求君衣裳，情不可當。觸諱西行，為伯生殃。君之上安，得生安存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f48be9dd95dd0d1a71ef8bdd4229fb0ac9192acf83e09fb073cb72a4b77bb088",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:74cf2586125b8c0121d576d2dc0a2c64ea99e18e37cf321a861eaad6a71174b8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "春鴻飛東，以馬貨金，利可得深。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a6cd2ff344d8e9b74d6c0b3add49e99a1f2102ea72b7c0ebdee2dbf967660675",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e69660b0f8fd935f8a564f178aaf95b3d7f1b80ddc3f115d35e878bd2839dda3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "禾生蟲蠹，還自剋賊，使我無得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd464f47c516695749ab6e83fc8131dd4762d20af666b9637cd2b27dbf309572",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:174a42bb1b4c0f483ec778b21a1b491702116ea04d1b5e8222af4a3edde03f57"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 34,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "桀亂無道，民散不聚。背室之家，遁迯出走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:38464da93c7edb86983552b9bc2c4179cf1f527f47060d993f8e65a3b79c75b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:97c14a3c304620691a9eac54fe2e57510753ce9d6db2e4fb927eba2978597091"
    }
  ]
}
